</element-citation></ref><ref id="REF3"><label>3</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><article-title>A randomized controlled trial of endovascular aneurysm repair versus open surgery for abdominal aortic aneurysms in low- to moderate-risk patients</article-title><source>J Vasc Surg</source><person-group>
